<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli soldiers have demolished several houses in southern Lebanon and the army has pulled back, allowing Lebanese villagers to return to wrecked homes. Lebanese President Aoun has demanded Israel’s withdrawal and warned Iran to stop interfering in Lebanon’s affairs. IDF intelligence warned that an Israeli strike on Iran could trigger a multifront war, while Israeli officials have pledged to limit damage after statements about foreign troops. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNSURNTGg4WlU3TElmSGlVQVl6YXc2aEVPaGIyNlE0N05EZGMycmEyOGJWSXJ6VklYV2dEVHFuQUxHRmQyUldCWVROQmhDVVlNSzhYdGJSOGdMT1NlWDlpb0ViVUdQZVdZdmsyTEJpTWlMM1haZ2F5Vm8xc2pZblNia2pFLXJ5Z3RNa2kzc1NqeHpjSE8xeWJwQ05zeVBnMUZoYy1DSm54ZDZFS0NRcDZKc2FoT3ppSWdhenc?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxORll3ZkNWTTRuZ19vOTViOVlJZXlXczJUa0ZOWmN6M3JSVVlQbmhhZ0FsTTFrQUE4VDhDbjV6cGNyTVNOSnZxTUF2Z1p2NmE0MmhweGlLelliRnY2RkhUalpwWTgybUdsYWljc200MmFoWEFlbF9JWUJGZXBlREdJdTg3Q1Etdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5lZUpxM2JnOUkyaWMtTjIwNGxMSVhVMVVmS0VMOGlqdHVadUJzNnFkTnIxOVJYZFBWVTZ5MFc5enpPcllHX1ZrQzR1Q0VKekhpemhqc1d2TThNMks2dzhwZzdGMTlJSlRxVHlPUUdlWkZBRHgy?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNaHpYa3pLV29nQVgwY1dJWVZNY0JjTm9hbXQyak9TMUR0c2R3SDNaWlpBbWF5NURYLXRYZGc1d0Z6Nk5hOGhKNjBPNVRzbU1rMmw5aGUzSkpBYWQ0b1FJYnNNY2RLWnBERlhld3NiVFU5eWJNSW5GZnRjVHlFNDhtU0haSHIyRXpoOFlxSW1pWmJOczk3eVNjckJXem9ibTlzZmR1M1dGT